WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.366 --> 00:00:09.603
Projects are for work with a start, an end, and a goal: a new store, a menu launch, a client job. In this video, you’ll start a project and follow it.

2
00:00:10.621 --> 00:00:19.922
Open Projects. Each card shows the goals, how far along the milestones and deliverables are, and what’s next. Anyone in the company can start one.

3
00:00:20.958 --> 00:00:28.681
Click New project, give it a name, goals, and dates. Draft with AI fills in the milestones and deliverables for you to check.

4
00:00:32.240 --> 00:00:39.984
Every project gets its own dashboard: progress, open and overdue work, and what’s due this week. Ask AI to change it for you.

5
00:00:41.022 --> 00:00:50.217
The plan holds the goals, the milestones with their due dates, and the deliverables. Projects can be public, or private to their owners, and have their own tickets.

6
00:00:51.240 --> 00:00:53.032
That’s Projects. Next, Chat.

